<title>BELGIUM: EU welcomes Bosnian elections.</title>
<headline>EU welcomes Bosnian elections.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Tuesday hailed Bosnia's flawed but peaceful election as a success and urged all parties to cooperate in rebuilding common institutions.</p>
<p>A statement by Ireland -- current president of the EU -- said it was important to to await a final report from those monitoring the elections, but meanwhile work should progress on post-war reconstruction.</p>
<p>Bosnia's first elections after a 43-month war looked on Tuesday to hand victory to Croat, Moslem and Serb communal hardliners -- leaving rival moderates far behind.</p>
</text>
